urname>Merrow</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Life between clocks: daily temporal patterns of human chronotypes.</article-title><source>J Biol Rhythms</source><volume>18</volume><fpage>80</fpage><lpage>90</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12568247</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005217-Largo1"><label>17</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Largo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Prader</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>1983</year><article-title>Pubertal development in Swiss girls.</article-title><source>Helv Paediatr Acta</source><volume>38</volume><fpage>229</fpage><lpage>243</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6618891</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005217-Hgg1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>H&#x000e4;gg</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Taranger</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>1980</year><article-title>Menarche and voice change as indicators of the pubertal growth spurt.</article-title><source>Acta Odontol Scand</source><volume>38</volume><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>186</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6932164</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005217-Bogaert1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bogaert</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Age at puberty and father absence in a national probability sample.</article-title><source>Journal of Adolescence</source><volume>28</volume><fpage>541</fpage><lpage>546</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16022888</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0005217-Biro1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Biro</surna